{
  "source": {
    "description": "Fortal's foundation colours in sRGB. Every value is a Dart colour literal (0xAARRGGBB). tool/fortal_palettes/generate.dart renders lib/src/fortal/theme/fortal_colors.dart from this file.",
    "scales": "An accent scale anchors steps 9, 10 and 11 on the accent, its strong tone and that tone again, step 3 on the subtle tint, and step 8 on the strong tone at 72 percent. Steps 1, 2, 4, 5, 6 and 7 are the subtle tint at 0.25, 0.5, 1.4, 1.8, 2.4 and 3.2 times its alpha; opaque steps 1 to 8 composite the alpha step over the page; step 12 mixes the strong tone halfway to the foreground in OKLab.",
    "alphaLadders": "blackAlpha and whiteAlpha are the black and white alpha ladders of @radix-ui/colors 3.0.0 (sRGB), unchanged; the notice below covers them.",
